stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: Create on POST submit
    pending --> running: Grade picks it up
    running --> accepted: all test cases pass
    running --> wrong_answer: some/all fail
    running --> compilation_error: Judge0 status=6
    running --> time_limit_exceeded: status=5
    running --> runtime_error: status=11
    running --> error: panic / parse failure
    pending --> pending_review: written answer (manual)
    pending --> pending_review: MCQ with no correct answers configured
    pending_review --> accepted: teacher grades > 0
    pending_review --> wrong_answer: teacher grades 0
    accepted --> accepted: idempotent
    wrong_answer --> accepted: teacher overrides via grade endpoint
